{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a game developer whose daily mission is to complete breakout-style levels - but with a revolutionary twist. Instead of controlling the paddle in this classic formula, YOU become the ball itself! Take direct control as you smash through obstacles in this innovative inversion of the genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ball-Protagonist Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master aerial maneuvers as you ricochet through levels, dynamically changing direction mid-flight to outmaneuver enemies and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891800/extras/499e9ad8e3d50a0ae98bd1d0c635dd47.poster.avif?t=1754534296\" width=580 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891800/extras/499e9ad8e3d50a0ae98bd1d0c635dd47.webm?t=1754534296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891800/extras/499e9ad8e3d50a0ae98bd1d0c635dd47.mp4?t=1754534296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Brick Defense System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place and rearrange brick barriers to create defensive positions while setting up perfect rebound angles for your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891800/extras/2b2819b641a0f6cb4b64ea4b11cc7631.poster.avif?t=1754534296\" width=260 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891800/extras/2b2819b641a0f6cb4b64ea4b11cc7631.webm?t=1754534296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite